  "status": "acknowledged",
  "message": "Your Business Gold Rewards Card application has been submitted. Approval, credit limit, merchant coding, and final rewards are subject to underwriting and the card terms. If approved and the $100,000 Apple Music charge earns the standard 1.0% rate, the estimated calculation remains $1,000 cash back minus the $200 annual fee, or $800 net first-year value, assuming the balance is paid in full and no promotional bonus applies."
